You feel spoiled.

Just for completeness, the suggestions we've had so far were:

  *  Polymorph into something big (taking off your other armor first);
     this requires polymorph control, or else a lot of luck -- and,
     of course, some way of polymorphing yourself.

  *  Fly over a sink.  Requires a sink somewhere on the level.

  *  Pray, and hope your god likes you.  This is probably a bad idea
     unless you've got a healthy food supply, because you have no way
     to *obtain* food, other than praying, until you remove the boots.

Other ideas:

  *  Find a helpful succubus and let *her* remove your boots.  Requires
     that you hang around praying for food until a succubus arrives,
     which may tax your patience to some degree.

  *  Get a nymph to steal them.  (Drop everything else.)  See above.
     
  *  Read a scroll of remove curse, destroy armor or enchant armor --
     removing all other armor before reading destroy/enchant.  Naturally
     this requires that you have one of these three types of scrolls.

  *  Zap yourself with a wand of cancellation.  Drop everything first.


